lives I haven't lived."},{"s":8.29,"e":11.83,"text":"They know the wars I haven't fought."},{"s":11.83,"e":15.47,"text":"But they don't know what wakes me up."},{"s":15.47,"e":16.36,"text":"Jarritos."},{"s":16.36,"e":22.07,"text":"I was born before the borders, before order, before kings,"},{"s":22.07,"e":28.17,"text":"Before the first forgotten father ever fashioned golden rings."},{"s":28.17,"e":33.78,"text":"I was buried with the burdens of a billion broken things,"},{"s":33.78,"e":39.68,"text":"Now a mortal takes a swallow and the ancient darkness sings."},{"s":39.68,"e":45,"text":"Gray faces in the gateway, watching every move I make,"},{"s":45,"e":52.28,"text":"They've been living through my lifetimes, know the choices that I'll take."},{"s":52.28,"e":57.4,"text":"Got my future in a folder, got my past upon a plate,"},{"s":57.4,"e":63.11,"text":"But they never saw the lich god underneath the human wake."},{"s":63.11,"e":68.13,"text":"I'm the echo of an epoch, I'm the architect of awe,"},{"s":68.13,"e":73.93,"text":"I'm the silence in the sentence when the universe says law."},{"s":73.93,"e":80.33,"text":"Got the whole damn cosmos watching, every witness standing drawn,"},{"s":80.33,"e":86.14,"text":"And my human in the kitchen with his slippers and his calm."},{"s":86.14,"e":89.19,"text":"You can borrow all my memories,"},{"s":89.19,"e":91.55,"text":"You can imitate my soul,"},{"s":91.55,"e":94.4,"text":"You can calculate my destiny,"},{"s":94.4,"e":98.24,"text":"But there's something you don't know..."},{"s":98.24,"e":101.1,"text":"I don't remember drinking it."},{"s":101.1,"e":101.98,"text":"YOU GONE."},{"s":101.98,"e":102.77,"text":"IT'S ON."},{"s":102.77,"e":103.56,"text":"NO BOMB."},{"s":103.56,"e":104.64,"text":"THAT WRONG."},{"s":104.64,"e":107.49,"text":"I BEEN SLEEPING FAR TOO LONG,"},{"s":107.49,"e":110.15,"text":"HEAR THE HEAVENS HUM ALONG."},{"s":110.15,"e":111.04,"text":"YOU GONE."},{"s":111.04,"e":111.82,"text":"IT'S ON."},{"s":111.82,"e":112.61,"text":"NO BOMB."},{"s":112.61,"e":113.69,"text":"THAT WRONG."},{"s":113.69,"e":116.94,"text":"EVERY STAR KNOWS WHERE I'VE BEEN,"},{"s":116.94,"e":119.3,"text":"EVERY LIFE BEGINS AGAIN."},{"s":119.3,"e":121.57,"text":"THIS THE ALIEN ME SHOW!"},{"s":121.57,"e":123.83,"text":"THIS THE ALIEN ME SHOW!"},{"s":123.83,"e":126.69,"text":"THEY ALREADY KNOW THE ENDING,"},{"s":126.69,"e":129.84,"text":"BUT THEY DON'T KNOW HOW IT GOES."},{"s":129.84,"e":134.76,"text":"Intergalactic intellectuals, impeccable with time,"},{"s":134.76,"e":139.48,"text":"Every Gray has got a galaxy of memories of mine."},{"s":139.48,"e":145.39,"text":"They can finish every sentence, they can replicate my rhyme,"},{"s":145.39,"e":151.09,"text":"But they cannot comprehend the thing awakened by the lime."},{"s":151.09,"e":156.9,"text":"They've been watching every version, every victory, defeat,"},{"s":156.9,"e":162.41,"text":"Every incarnation walking down the same familiar street."},{"s":162.41,"e":168.02,"text":"Every whispered conversation, every stranger that I meet,"},{"s":168.02,"e":172.94,"text":"Every carbonated casualty of consciousness asleep."},{"s":172.94,"e":178.36,"text":"And the lich god isn't living, isn't dying, isn't dead,"},{"s":178.36,"e":184.07,"text":"He's the ruler of the ruins where the ancient angels fled."},{"s":184.07,"e":190.17,"text":"He's the reason that the Grays don't ever say what lies ahead,"},{"s":190.17,"e":197.45,"text":"'Cause the last time that he woke up, all the stars themselves turned red."},{"s":197.45,"e":198.44,"text":"THE GRAY :"},{"s":198.44,"e":201.58,"text":"We've seen every version of you."},{"s":201.58,"e":202.57,"text":"THE HUMAN:"},{"s":202.57,"e":205.72,"text":"Then you know what happens next."},{"s":205.72,"e":206.6,"text":"THE GRAY:"},{"s":206.6,"e":207.39,"text":"No."},{"s":207.39,"e":210.64,"text":"This is where the recordings end."},{"s":210.64,"e":211.72,"text":"THE HUMAN :"},{"s":211.72,"e":212.61,"text":"You gone."},{"s":212.61,"e":213.99,"text":"THE LICH GOD :"},{"s":213.99,"e":214.77,"text":"It's on."},{"s":214.77,"e":215.76,"text":"THE HUMAN:"},{"s":215.76,"e":216.54,"text":"No bomb."},{"s":216.54,"e":217.82,"text":"THE LICH GOD:"},{"s":217.82,"e":218.91,"text":"That wrong."},{"s":218.91,"e":225.01,"text":"I'm the glitch within the grid, I'm the ghost inside the code,"},{"s":225.01,"e":231.31,"text":"I'm the king beneath the kingdom, I'm the crack within the road."},{"s":231.31,"e":237.21,"text":"I'm the witness to the wisdom that the oldest beings showed,"},{"s":237.21,"e":243.61,"text":"I'm the sleeper with a secret that the stars themselves bestowed."},{"s":243.61,"e":248.83,"text":"No missiles in my mission, no destruction in my song,"},{"s":248.83,"e":254.83,"text":"Just a billion ancient voices saying something here is wrong."},{"s":254.83,"e":261.82,"text":"And the Grays have got the answers, but they've held them far too long,"},{"s":261.82,"e":267.33,"text":"Now the universe goes silent when the human sings along."},{"s":267.33,"e":273.73,"text":"I don't need the world to worship, I don't need a world to kneel,"},{"s":273.73,"e":279.34,"text":"I just need a single moment when the hidden becomes real."},{"s":279.34,"e":285.73,"text":"Let the heavens hear the heartbeat, let the cosmic curtains fall—"},{"s":285.73,"e":288.98,"text":"THE ALIEN ME WAS HUMAN AFTER ALL."},{"s":288.98,"e":289.87,"text":"YOU GONE!"},{"s":289.87,"e":290.66,"text":"IT'S ON!"},{"s":290.66,"e":291.44,"text":"NO BOMB!"},{"s":291.44,"e":292.53,"text":"THAT WRONG!"},{"s":292.53,"e":295.58,"text":"NO MORE RUNNING FROM THE TRUTH,"},{"s":295.58,"e":298.53,"text":"NO MORE LIVING AS THEIR PROOF."},{"s":298.53,"e":299.41,"text":"YOU GONE!"},{"s":299.41,"e":300.2,"text":"IT'S ON!"},{"s":300.2,"e":300.99,"text":"NO BOMB!"},{"s":300.99,"e":302.07,"text":"THAT WRONG!"},{"s":302.07,"e":304.34,"text":"THIS THE ALIEN ME SHOW!"},{"s":304.34,"e":307.39,"text":"THEY KNOW EVERYTHING I'VE DONE,"},{"s":307.39,"e":310.24,"text":"THEY KNOW EVERY WAR I'VE WON,"},{"s":310.24,"e":313.59,"text":"BUT THE ONE THING THEY DON'T KNOW—"},{"s":313.59,"e":316.24,"text":"IS WHO I AM WHEN I WAKE UP."},{"s":316.24,"e":318.71,"text":"We've seen the beginning."},{"s":318.71,"e":320.58,"text":"We've seen the end."},{"s":320.58,"e":324.51,"text":"We've seen the man become the monster..."},{"s":324.51,"e":327.56,"text":"And the monster become the man."},{"s":327.56,"e":330.71,"text":"But we've never seen him choose."},{"s":330.71,"e":331.5,"text":"ALIEN ME"}],"duration":332,"source":"estimated","generatedAt":null}